{"meta":{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","type":"tv","name":"Ghost Dimension","logo":"https://i.imgur.com/a0jOxez.png","poster":"https://i.imgur.com/a0jOxez.png","posterShape":"square","genres":["English Entertainment"],"channelNumber":961,"behaviorHints":{"isLive":true,"defaultVideoId":"ftv_GhostDimension_us"},"videos":[{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension – Live","released":"2026-11-28T00:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T00:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension – Live","released":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension – Live","released":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T08:37:53Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Dangerous Demon of The Stork Inn","released":"2026-11-28T08:37:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T08:37:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T09:30:53Z","overview":"Sean heads to Wigan to investigate a location with history dating back to 900AD. Encountering a spirit that attacks him, will the team be safe tonight as they come face to face with pure evil?","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Buried Beneath The Bowling Green","released":"2026-11-28T09:30:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T09:30:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T10:19:53Z","overview":"Buried under the location Sean investigates tonight, is the bones of the deceased and it appears that they are at unrest. Will Sean solve the mystery of who is haunting this location?","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension: Demons on The Buses","released":"2026-11-28T10:19:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T10:19:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T11:17:53Z","overview":"Hidden in St Helens, is a museum that is home to demonic and dark entities trapped inside of vehicles.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Not a Very Fun Day at The Beech Caves","released":"2026-11-28T11:17:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T11:17:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T12:06:53Z","overview":"Witchcraft, demons and ghosts have all been reported to haunt these caves. Sean investigates this network of tunnels deep underground and uncovers that all is not as it seems. This is not a day out at the seaside at Beech Caves.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Lockdown: Ghosts of The Asylum","released":"2026-11-28T12:06:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:06:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:05:53Z","overview":"Paul and Sean visit one very haunted Asylum in Manchester and come to face with ghostly souls that are haunting the building. The Asylum housed the criminally insane and it would appear, as the building closed, some of them never left!","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: The Curse Of The Pendle Witches - Part 1","released":"2026-11-28T13:05:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:05:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:58:53Z","overview":"Sean heads deep into the Pendle Hills in search of the Pendle Witches that went to trial in 1612 and were hung for witchcraft. The investigation takes an unexpected twist with a stop at the New Inn, Pendles most haunted pub.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: The Curse Of The Pendle Witches - Part 2","released":"2026-11-28T13:58:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:58:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:58:53Z","overview":"Sean continues his investigation of Pendle Hill and ventures even deeper into the hills. The night takes an unexpected turn with a dramatic ending, which he believes was caused by the witches.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Shadow Menace Haunting Morley Market - Part 1","released":"2026-11-28T14:58:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:58:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:53:53Z","overview":"Sean heads to the town of Morley to investigate the infamous Morley Market. A place once bustling with people from years gone by, it is now haunted by shadow figures, and they appear to want to make themselves known.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Shadow Menace Haunting Morley Market - Part 2","released":"2026-11-28T15:53:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:53:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:51:53Z","overview":"Sean continues the investigation at Morley Market and appears to be followed by a spirit person that wants to touch him and distract him from investigating certain parts of the main hall. Will he uncover who this spirit is?","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension: A Night at The Leeds Museum Part 1","released":"2026-11-28T16:51:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:51:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:40:53Z","overview":"Four floors of terror! Objects from around the world are at home in the museum, but what is attached to them, which now roams the floors and corridors after dark?","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension: A Night at The Leeds Museum Part 2","released":"2026-11-28T17:40:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:40:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:29:53Z","overview":"With activity sending the team into a spin on the top floor, is there something attached to the museum's main attraction, the mummy?","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension: Haunted Theme Park - Part 1","released":"2026-11-28T18:29:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:29:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:20:53Z","overview":"What could be haunting an abandoned theme park in Lancashire? Ghost Dimension seek out paranormal activity in Camelot and they are in for a ride!","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension: Haunted Theme Park - Part 2","released":"2026-11-28T19:20:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:20:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:09:53Z","overview":"Ghost Dimension continue investigating Camelot Theme Park, the UK's most haunted and come face to face, with a powerful paranormal entity.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Historic Hauntings of Whittington Castle - Part 1","released":"2026-11-28T20:09:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:09:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:58:53Z","overview":"Sean heads to Oswestry to investigate claims of hauntings at a castle thousands of years old, and believed to be haunted by an angry judge. Will any of the souls that departed here come out to play?","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Historic Hauntings of Whittington Castle - Part 2","released":"2026-11-28T20:58:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:58:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:48:53Z","overview":"Sean continues his investigation of the castle and attempts to make contact with the spirit world. It appears he is not alone.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Haunting of The Sad Cavalier at The Ring O Bells - Part 1","released":"2026-11-28T21:48:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:48:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T22:37:53Z","overview":"Sean heads to Middleton, Manchester to investigate claims that a sad cavalier named Edward is haunting this location. Ring O Bells has also been used for druid rituals. Will he be able to summon any spirits tonight?","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension Flying Solo: Haunting of The Sad Cavalier at The Ring O Bells - Part 2","released":"2026-11-28T22:37:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T22:37:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:26:53Z","overview":"As Sean continues his investigation at The Ring O Bells pub, he finds that out that there is more haunting this location, than just the spirits lurking behind the bar.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension: The Blues Haunting at The Winslow Hotel","released":"2026-11-28T23:26:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:26:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:15:53Z","overview":"Bex, Sean and the team head to Liverpool and investigate a very famous hotel, which Everton football club supporters have frequented for over 100 years and it would appear that some of the guests have never checked out.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension: I Hear a Baby Crying","released":"2026-11-29T00:15:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:15:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:04:53Z","overview":"The team investigate the Market Hotel in Bolton. Believed to be haunted by the lost soul of a previous landlord and a guest who likes to make herself known. They make contact with spirits from the other side and witness first hand paranormal activity.","genres":["Series","Paranormal"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension – Live","released":"2026-11-29T01:04:53Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T01:04:53Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension – Live","released":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension – Live","released":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_GhostDimension_us","title":"Ghost Dimension – Live","released":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T12:00:00Z","genres":["En